    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rookie cop whose mundane night shift has turned into an all-out battle for survival. As you fight to uncover the truth behind the monsters plaguing your city, you'll have to decide whether to tame the beast within, or unleash it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle monstrosities with:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ weapons including, firearms, melee weapons, and special equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Werewolf Powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffs inspired by classic action movies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.poster.avif?t=1751069187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.webm?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.mp4?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices matter and will affect the citizens of Key City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a059098f7667d1356e8e3c5395a7f9ed.poster.avif?t=1751069187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a059098f7667d1356e8e3c5395a7f9ed.webm?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a059098f7667d1356e8e3c5395a7f9ed.mp4?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting evidence is necessary to discover who's behind this Wolf Night!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rookie cop whose mundane night shift has turned into an all-out battle for survival. As you fight to uncover the truth behind the monsters plaguing your city, you'll have to decide whether to tame the beast within, or unleash it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle monstrosities with:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ weapons including, firearms, melee weapons, and special equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Werewolf Powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffs inspired by classic action movies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.poster.avif?t=1751069187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.webm?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/3f1d407f6e97fa6ee850da474b4724c7.mp4?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices matter and will affect the citizens of Key City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a059098f7667d1356e8e3c5395a7f9ed.poster.avif?t=1751069187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584550/extras/a059098f7667d1356e8e3c5395a7f9ed.webm?t=1751069187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst